---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Hari Kotian | Insurance Support"
  description="Hari Kotian leads Insurance Support, a Bengaluru-based insurance guidance and claim assistance service."
  canonical="https://insurancesupport.online/about/"
>
  <main id="main" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">About Hari Kotian</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 mb-6">Hari Kotian (IRDAI registration number 0149161D) leads Insurance Support, which provides insurance guidance and claim assistance from Bengaluru.</p>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">For current business details, service scope, and contact information, see the <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="/about/">Insurance Support profile</a>.</p>
    <a class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700" href="/contact">Contact Insurance Support</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
